AHS.TeachingMaterialContentStore["tm_29"] = {"summary":{"materialId":"tm_29","coreConcepts":["氣體的共同性","氣體具有高度流動性。","氣體具有可壓縮性與膨脹性。","氣體粒子本身體積極小，且可向各方向自由運動。","氣體體積可視為其所在容器的體積。","氣體壓力來自氣體粒子快速撞擊容器器壁。","氣體體積會受壓力與溫度影響。","氣體壓力的測量","托里切利以水銀氣壓計測量大氣壓。","海平面、緯度45度的平均大氣壓可支撐760 mmHg。","1 atm = 760 mmHg = 760 torr = 76 cmHg","1 atm = 1.013×10^5 Pa","開口式壓力計必須考慮外界大氣壓。","閉口式壓力計的另一端不受大氣壓直接影響。","三大氣體定律","⭐ 波以耳定律：定溫、定量，P ∝ 1/V，PV = k。","⭐ 查理－給呂薩克定律（SOURCE亦稱查理定律）：定壓、定量，V ∝ T(K)。","⭐ 亞佛加厥定律：定溫、定壓，V ∝ n。","三者可整合成理想氣體方程式。","理想氣體方程式"],"definitions":["氣體壓力：粒子撞擊器壁形成","大氣壓：外界大氣造成的壓力","atm：大氣壓力單位","mmHg：汞柱壓力單位","torr：1 mmHg對應的壓力單位","Pa：SI壓力單位","波以耳定律：定T、定n：PV=k","查理定律：定P、定n：V/T=k","亞佛加厥定律：定T、定P：V/n=k","理想氣體：用模型描述氣體行為","STP：SOURCE：0℃、1 atm","莫耳體積：SOURCE：STP下理想氣體1 mol為22.4 L","分壓：混合氣體中某一成分所貢獻的壓力","道耳頓分壓定律：總壓＝各分壓總和","絕對溫度：T(K)=t(℃)+273.15","壓縮性／膨脹性：外加壓力時體積變小；壓力解除後恢復原來的體積","托（torr）：1 mmHg 的壓力，用來紀念托里切利","帕斯卡（Pa）：SI 壓力單位，1 N/m²","閉口式壓力計：一端封閉並抽成真空，P_gas = Δh","開口式壓力計：一端通大氣，P_gas = P_atm ± Δh","絕對零度：0 K = −273.15 °C","絕對溫標：克耳文提出（1848），T = t + 273.15","標準溫壓（STP）：0 °C、1 atm","莫耳體積：STP 時 1 mol 理想氣體的體積，22.4 L","理想氣體常數 R：數值會隨使用的單位改變","理想氣體：粒子本身體積可以忽略、粒子之間沒有作用力、碰撞是完全彈性碰撞","分壓：某一成分氣體單獨占有整個容器時的壓力","莫耳分率 Xₐ：nₐ/nₜ = Pₐ/Pₜ","飽和蒸氣壓：溫度固定時是定值，排水集氣法要扣除","氮醉（氮麻醉）：高壓下氮氣分壓過大造成的麻醉現象"],"pitfalls":["波以耳 vs 查理：波以耳固定T；查理固定P","查理公式使用℃：❌ 應使用K","亞佛加厥定律固定條件：T、P固定","PV=k：只在定T、定n條件下","V∝T：必須定P、定n","V∝n：必須定T、定P","atm與Pa：單位不同，1 atm=1.013×10^5 Pa","atm與mmHg：1 atm=760 mmHg","分壓與總壓：總壓為各分壓總和","真實氣體最接近理想氣體：SOURCE：高溫、低壓","STP莫耳體積：SOURCE：22.4 L/mol","閉口式與開口式壓力計：閉口式 P = Δh；開口式 P = P_atm ± Δh（氣體那一側液面較低時用「+」）","攝氏溫度與絕對溫度：所有氣體定律都只能用 K 計算","「與 t 成線性」與「與 T 成正比」：V 與攝氏溫度 t 是線性關係，但不是正比","分子數與原子數：亞佛加厥定律說的是分子數；題目問原子數時要乘上每個分子的原子數","STP 與常溫常壓：STP 是 0 °C、1 atm（22.4 L）；常溫約 25 °C","理想氣體的條件：高溫、低壓，不是低溫、高壓","分壓總和適用的範圍：只適用於互不反應的氣體","向上與向下排空氣法：比空氣重（M > 28.8）用向上排空氣法；比空氣輕用向下排空氣法","⚠️ 忘記固定條件。","⚠️ 查理定律直接使用攝氏溫度。","⚠️ 壓力計液面高度差加減方向判斷錯誤。","⚠️ atm、mmHg、Pa沒有統一。","⚠️ 將原子數直接當莫耳數。","⚠️ 將分壓當成總壓。"],"memorize":["為什麼洋芋片包裝袋在登山時會膨脹？","為什麼腳踏車打氣筒能增加輪胎內壓力？","為什麼液態氮中的氣球縮小？","為什麼同溫同壓下吹入更多氣體會使氣球變大？","⭐ 壓力單位換算：atm、mmHg、torr、Pa；單位混用；先統一單位","⭐ 壓力計：液面高度差＋大氣壓；加減方向判斷錯；先判哪側壓力大","⭐ 波以耳：P1V1=P2V2；忘記固定T、n；先寫條件","⭐ 查理：V1/T1=V2/T2；直接代℃；全部轉K","⭐ 亞佛加厥：V1/n1=V2/n2；把分子數、原子數、莫耳數混在一起；先算粒子比例","⭐ 理想氣體：PV=nRT；R單位與P、V不匹配；先確認單位","⭐ 莫耳體積：STP、22.4L/mol；把質量當莫耳數；先求n","⭐ 真實氣體：高溫低壓；低溫高壓判斷反；記「高溫低壓較理想」","⭐ 分壓：Ptotal=ΣPi；只加某一部分；列出所有成分","⭐ 綜合題：多定律連續判斷；一步錯導致後面全錯；每一步寫固定條件","波以耳定律 ↔ 呼吸運動、打氣筒。","查理定律 ↔ 氣球受冷縮小、熱氣球。","亞佛加厥定律 ↔ 吹氣球、氣體粒子數。","理想氣體方程式 ↔ 壓力、體積、莫耳數、溫度的綜合計算。","氣體密度 ↔ 分子量：PM=dRT。","分壓 ↔ 空氣為多種氣體組成的混合氣體。"],"reviewSuggestions":["思考一：為什麼氣體定律計算特別容易錯？","因為每一條定律都有「固定條件」。不能看到P、V、T、n就直接套PV=nRT而忽略題目條件。","思考二：為什麼攝氏溫度不能直接代入查理定律？","因為比例關係必須以絕對溫度K表示；SOURCE明確提供K=℃+273.15。","思考三：為什麼理想氣體與真實氣體要分開？","理想氣體是模型。SOURCE透過不同氣體的STP莫耳體積與圖形比較，說明真實氣體會偏離理想值。","為什麼托里切利用水銀而不用水？依課文「想一想」：1 atm 約等於 10.3 m 水柱（水銀密度 13.6 × 0.76 m ≈ 10.3 m），水柱太高，不實用。","熱氣球嘉年華為什麼辦在夏季？提示：比較內外空氣的密度差，以及夏季的天氣型態。","為什麼 NH₃ 偏離理想氣體比分子量相近的 CH₄ 明顯？提示：NH₃ 有極性，分子之間有氫鍵。","「把氮氣比例降到 70%」為什麼能減少潛水時的氮醉？提示：深水時總壓上升，N₂ 分壓 = Pₜ × X_N₂。","現行 IUPAC 把 STP 定為 0 °C、1 bar，這時莫耳體積約為 22.7 L。這與課本的 22.4 L 有什麼差別？"],"subject":"化學","grade":"高二","chapter":"第二章：氣體（2-1 氣體性質、2-2 氣體定律、2-3 理想氣體方程式、2-4 氣體分壓）","title":"第二章：氣體（2-1 氣體性質、2-2 氣體定律、2-3 理想氣體方程式、2-4 氣體分壓）"},"questions":[{"id":"tm_29_q1","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"定溫、定量氣體的體積由80 mL變為100 mL，原壓力為1 atm，則新壓力為何？","options":["0.80 atm","1.00 atm","1.25 atm","1.50 atm"],"answer":"0.80 atm","explanation":"波以耳定律P1V1=P2V2，所以P2=1×80/100=0.80 atm。 【出處】SOURCE「2-2.1 波以耳定律」；SOURCE原題洋芋片包裝題。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q2","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"1 atm等於多少mmHg？","options":["76","760","1013","10336"],"answer":"760","explanation":"SOURCE明確給出1 atm=760 mmHg。 【出處】SOURCE「2-1.2 氣體壓力的測量」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q3","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"3","type":"single_choice","question":"查理定律中，氣體體積與哪一項成正比？","options":["攝氏溫度","絕對溫度","壓力","密度"],"answer":"絕對溫度","explanation":"定壓、定量下，V∝T(K)。 【出處】SOURCE「2-2.2 查理－給呂薩克定律」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q4","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"4","type":"single_choice","question":"STP在SOURCE中定義為何？","options":["0℃、1atm","25℃、1atm","0℃、760Pa","273℃、1atm"],"answer":"0℃、1atm","explanation":"SOURCE明確定義STP為0℃、1atm。 【出處】SOURCE「2-3.1 理想氣體方程式」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q5","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"5","type":"single_choice","question":"理想氣體方程式為何？","options":["PV=k","V/n=k","PV=nRT","P+V=nRT"],"answer":"PV=nRT","explanation":"三大氣體定律整合可得PV=nRT。 【出處】SOURCE「2-3.1 理想氣體方程式」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q6","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"6","type":"single_choice","question":"0.010 mol與0.005 mol氣體在相同T、V下各自壓力為186與93mmHg，混合後總壓為何？","options":["93","186","279","372 mmHg"],"answer":"279","explanation":"道耳頓分壓定律：186+93=279mmHg。 【出處】SOURCE「2-4.1 道耳頓分壓定律」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q7","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"7","type":"single_choice","question":"哪種條件下真實氣體較接近理想氣體？","options":["低溫高壓","高溫低壓","低溫低壓","高壓高溫"],"answer":"高溫低壓","explanation":"SOURCE明確指出高溫、低壓時較接近理想氣體。 【出處】SOURCE「理想氣體 vs 真實氣體」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q8","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"8","type":"single_choice","question":"定溫、定壓下，氣體莫耳數增加，體積如何變化？","options":["不變","減少","增加","先增後減"],"answer":"增加","explanation":"亞佛加厥定律：V∝n。 【出處】SOURCE「2-2.3 亞佛加厥定律」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q9","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"9","type":"single_choice","question":"1 atm約等於多少Pa？","options":["760","1013","1.013×10^5","9.8×10^5 Pa"],"answer":"1.013×10^5","explanation":"SOURCE給出1 atm=1.013×10^5 Pa。 【出處】SOURCE「2-1.2 氣體壓力的測量」。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_29_q10","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"10","type":"single_choice","question":"使用查理定律進行比例計算時，應使用哪種溫度？","options":["℃","℉","K","℃與K皆可"],"answer":"K","explanation":"查理定律是體積與絕對溫度成正比，因此使用K。 【出處】SOURCE「2-2.2 查理－給呂薩克定律」。 Claude 認為： 題型一覽 壓力計讀數與單位換算（mmHg、atm、Pa） 波以耳、查理定律的兩狀態計算（P₁V₁ = P₂V₂，V₁/T₁ = V₂/T₂） 亞佛加厥定律的分子數、原子數比 PV = nRT 與 PM = dRT 求分子量 讀 PV/nRT 圖判斷是否接近理想氣體 分壓與莫耳分率 排水集氣法扣除水的飽和蒸氣壓 定律與生活現象配對（例如習題 12） SOURCE 未附解答的練習題，參考解法 J 型管氦氣題：P₁ = 76 + 14 = 90 cmHg，P₂ = 76 + 24 = 100 cmHg。90 × 5 = 100 × V₂，所以 V₂ = 4.5 mL。 CH₄ 與 C₂H₂ 原子總數相同：每個分子的原子數是 5 與 4，所以 n 比 = 4 : 5，體積比 A : B = 4 : 5。 Zn + HCl 排水集氣：P_H₂ = 760 − 23.8 = 736.2 mmHg。n = (736.2/760 × 0.820) / (0.0821 × 298) ≈ 0.0325 mol。 習題 4（活塞兩室）：兩室壓力相等，V 與 T 成正比，V左 : V右 = 400 : 300，總體積 2V。所以 V左 = 8V/7，增加 V/7。 習題 10：(1) He（22.44）與 H₂（22.43）大於 22.41。(2) NH₃ 有極性，分子之間有氫鍵，吸引力大，所以莫耳體積偏小。 習題 11：設氮氣柱高 h，則 P = 76 + h。76 × 57 = (76 + h)h，所以 h = 38 cm，P = 114 cmHg。 習題 12：(1) 乙 (2) 庚 (3) 丙 (4) 乙、丙、庚 習題 14：總體積 = 0.7 × 0.082 × 300 / 0.5 = 34.44 L，(1) A 的體積 ≈ 17.2 L。nA : nB = 300 : 400，所以 (3) nA = 0.3 mol。(2) P = 0.3 × 0.082 × 400 / 17.22 ≈ 0.571 atm（即 4/7 atm）。 單選練習題","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T04:02:35.599Z"},{"id":"tm_30_q1","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-1","type":"calculation","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）根據下列各式壓力計裝置圖（皆填充水銀），回答問題：圖(一)開口式壓力計，開口端承受 1 atm，A 氣體端汞面比開口端汞面高（兩側汞面距底部分別為 60 cm 與 20 cm）；圖(二)開口式壓力計，B 氣體壓力 1.5 atm，開口端汞面比 B 氣體端高（兩側汞面距底部分別為 60 cm 與 20 cm）；圖(三)閉口式壓力計，閉口端為真空，兩側汞面高度差 91.2 cm。(1) 圖(一)中，A 氣體的壓力值為多少 mmHg？(2) 圖(二)中，大氣壓力值為多少 mmHg？(3) 圖(三)中，C 氣體的壓力值為多少 atm？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 360 mmHg；(2) 740 mmHg；(3) 1.2 atm","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）(1) A 氣體端汞面較高，P_A ＋ (60 − 20) cmHg ＝ 1 atm ＝ 760 mmHg，P_A ＝ 760 − 400 ＝ 360 mmHg。(2) 開口端較高，P_B ＝ P_atm ＋ 400 mmHg，1.5 × 760 ＝ 1140 ＝ P_atm ＋ 400，P_atm ＝ 740 mmHg。(3) 閉口式（真空）P_C ＝ 汞柱高度差 ＝ 91.2 cmHg ＝ 91.2/76 ＝ 1.2 atm。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":62,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"壓力計","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-1 氣體性質","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-1（課本第62頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q2","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-1","type":"calculation","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）假若當時大氣壓力 1 atm ＝ 76 cmHg，則：（取至小數點以下第二位）(1) 圖(一)為開口式壓力計，開口端汞面比 A 氣體端汞面高 67 cm，A 氣體壓力為多少 atm？(2) 圖(二)為閉口式壓力計（閉口端為真空），兩側汞面高度差 10.3 cm，B 氣體壓力為多少 atm？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 1.88 atm；(2) 0.14 atm","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(1) 開口端較高，P_A ＝ 76 ＋ 67 ＝ 143 cmHg ＝ 143/76 ≈ 1.88 atm。(2) 閉口式 P_B ＝ 10.3 cmHg ＝ 10.3/76 ≈ 0.14 atm。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":62,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"壓力計","difficulty":"易","section":"2-1 氣體性質","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-1（課本第62頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q3","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-2","type":"calculation","question":"登山活動是近年來國人喜歡的運動之一，隨著登山人數的增加，業者對於登山的補給品也不斷推陳出新。洋芋片為登山客喜愛的產品之一，利用氮氣填充包裝增加保存期限及減少洋芋片因擠壓而破碎。假設山下的大氣壓力為 1 大氣壓、填充於洋芋片袋的氮氣體積為 80 毫升；在登山過程中，因為壓力不斷減少，使得袋內的氮氣體積增加變為 100 毫升，則此時山上的壓力值為多少毫米汞柱（mmHg）？（將溫度視為定值）","options":[],"answer":"608 mmHg","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）密閉包裝中氮氣的莫耳數與溫度不變，PV 為定值：1 atm × 80 mL ＝ P × 100 mL，P ＝ 0.8 atm ＝ 0.8 × 760 ＝ 608 mmHg。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":66,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體定律","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-2（課本第66頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q4","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-2","type":"calculation","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）如圖之 J 型玻璃管，口徑為 0.50 公分。於 25°C、1 大氣壓時，已知左方玻璃管上方密閉空間中的氣體為氖氣，其體積為 5 毫升，此時左、右玻璃管中之汞柱液面高度差為 14 公分（右方開口端較高）。假設氖氣可視為理想氣體，今由右方開口處加入一些汞，使得最終左、右汞柱液面高度差為 24 公分。試問此時氖氣的體積為若干毫升？","options":[],"answer":"4.5 mL","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）開口端較高：P₁ ＝ 76 ＋ 14 ＝ 90 cmHg，P₂ ＝ 76 ＋ 24 ＝ 100 cmHg。90 × 5 ＝ 100 × V，V ＝ 4.5 mL。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":66,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律（J 型管）","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-2 氣體定律","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-2（課本第66頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q5","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-3","type":"calculation","question":"定壓下，未知溫度的氣球體積為 2.80 L，將此氣球置於 0°C 的冰水之中，觀察其體積變為 2.57 L。則原來氣球的攝氏溫度應為幾度？（取至小數點以下第一位）","options":[],"answer":"24.4°C","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）定壓下 V₁/V₂ ＝ T₁/T₂：2.80/2.57 ＝ (273 ＋ t)/273，t ≈ 24.4°C。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":70,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"查理定律","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體定律","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-3（課本第70頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q6","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-3","type":"calculation","question":"定壓下，測量定量氣體之體積，當溫度 20°C 時，氣體體積為 500 mL；在相同條件下，將溫度上升至 100°C 時，氣體體積變為 633 mL。試根據此實驗觀察，計算絕對零度相當於攝氏若干°C？（取至小數點以下第二位）","options":[],"answer":"−280.75°C","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）體積與攝氏溫度成直線：斜率 ＝ (633 − 500)/(100 − 20) ＝ 1.6625 mL/°C。體積為 0 時 t ＝ 20 − 500/1.6625 ≈ 20 − 300.75 ＝ −280.75°C。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":70,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.94,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"查理定律與絕對零度","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-2 氣體定律","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-3（課本第70頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q7","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-4","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫、同壓下，甲烷（CH₄）氣體體積為 V 升、所含有的原子數為 x 個，則取多少升的氨氣（NH₃）會與甲烷氣體所含有的原子數相同？","options":["(A) V/4","(B) 3V/4","(C) 5V/4","(D) 7V/4","(E) 2V"],"answer":"(C) 5V/4","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）同溫同壓下體積代表莫耳數。CH₄ 每分子 5 個原子、NH₃ 每分子 4 個原子：V/5 ＝ y/4 個（莫耳）比例，y ＝ 5V/4。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":71,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體定律","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-4（課本第71頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q8","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-4","type":"calculation","question":"同溫、同壓下，A、B 兩玻璃瓶中分別盛裝 CH₄(g) 與 C₂H₂(g)，已知兩容器中之原子總數相同，則 A、B 兩玻璃瓶的體積比為何？","options":[],"answer":"A：B ＝ 4：5","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）CH₄ 每分子 5 個原子、C₂H₂ 每分子 4 個原子。原子數相同時分子數比 ＝ 1/5：1/4 ＝ 4：5，同溫同壓下體積比 ＝ 分子數比 ＝ 4：5。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":71,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體定律","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-4（課本第71頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q9","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-5","type":"calculation","question":"在 1 atm、27°C 下，有一個體積 10.0 升的開口容器，將 80 克某液體放入此容器後密封，加熱至 127°C 時，該密閉容器內的壓力變為 9.53 atm。假設在 27°C 時該液體之蒸氣壓可忽略；在 127°C 時該液體已完全汽化，並將氣體視為理想氣體。溫度上升的過程中，密閉容器內的空氣壓力變為原來的 4/3 倍。根據上述實驗結果回答下列問題：（假設絕對零度為 −273°C）(1) 在 127°C 時密閉容器內空氣的壓力為若干大氣壓？(2) 在 127°C 時密閉容器內該液體蒸氣的壓力為若干大氣壓？(3) 該液體分子量為何？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 1.33 atm；(2) 8.2 atm；(3) 32","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）(1) 空氣壓力 ＝ 1 × 4/3 ≈ 1.33 atm。(2) 蒸氣壓力 ＝ 9.53 − 1.33 ＝ 8.20 atm。(3) PV ＝ (w/M)RT：8.20 × 10 ＝ (80/M) × 0.082 × 400，M ＝ 32。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":76,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.94,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式、分壓","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-3 理想氣體方程式","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-5（課本第76頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q10","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-5","type":"calculation","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）利用閉口式壓力計進行氣體壓力的測量實驗：錐形瓶中置入內含 0.74 克的乙醚玻璃球（乙醚分子量為 74），並將錐形瓶抽成真空狀態，錐形瓶連接閉口式壓力計。已知錐形瓶的體積為 1000 mL，當時溫度為 27°C。利用玻璃管將玻璃球敲破，待乙醚完全汽化後，則閉口式壓力計兩側的水銀高度有何差異？","options":[],"answer":"約 187 mmHg（18.7 cm）","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）n ＝ 0.74/74 ＝ 0.010 mol。P ＝ nRT/V ＝ 0.010 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 1.0 ＝ 0.246 atm ≈ 187 mmHg；閉口式壓力計高度差即為氣體壓力，約 18.7 cm。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":76,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-3 理想氣體方程式","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-5（課本第76頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q11","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-6","type":"single_choice","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）在溫度 0°C，分別測量 1.0 mol 氫、甲烷、二氧化碳三種氣體的體積和壓力，作成 PV/nRT 與壓力（大氣壓）的關係圖(一)：H₂ 由 1.0 緩慢上升；CH₄ 先降到約 0.8 再上升；CO₂ 先急降到約 0.3 再上升。另在壓力 1 大氣壓，分別測量 1.0 mol 氫、氮、二氧化碳三種氣體的體積和溫度，作成 PV/nRT 與絕對溫度的關係圖(二)：H₂ 幾乎貼在 1.00；N₂ 由低溫上升，常溫附近已很接近 1.00；CO₂ 上升較慢、仍低於 1.00。兩圖中的虛線（PV/nRT ＝ 1）為理想氣體。根據圖(一)與圖(二)的實驗結果，下列敘述何者正確？","options":["(A) 溫度 0°C、壓力較小時，三種氣體中，甲烷最接近理想氣體","(B) 壓力 1 大氣壓與常溫時，三種氣體中，氫氣最接近理想氣體","(C) 由圖(一)可知，當體積非常小時，三種氣體都相當接近理想氣體","(D) 由圖(一)與圖(二)，可以獲得如下結論：壓力趨近於 0 大氣壓，且溫度大於 500 K 時，四種氣體都相當接近理想氣體","(E) 由圖(一)與圖(二)，可以獲得如下結論：壓力趨近於 500 大氣壓，且溫度趨近於 0 K，四種氣體都相當接近理想氣體"],"answer":"(D) 由圖(一)與圖(二)，可以獲得如下結論：壓力趨近於 0 大氣壓，且溫度大於 500 K 時，四種氣體都相當接近理想氣體","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）(A) 0°C、壓力較小時 H₂ 較接近理想氣體；(B) 由圖(二)，1 atm、常溫時 N₂ 較接近理想氣體；(C) 體積非常小即壓力大，愈不接近理想氣體；(E) 溫度愈低、壓力愈大，愈不接近理想氣體。低壓、高溫最接近理想氣體，(D) 正確。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":78,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.88,"needsReview":true,"knowledgePoint":"理想氣體與真實氣體","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-3 理想氣體方程式","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-6（課本第78頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q12","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-7","type":"calculation","question":"溫度 27.0°C 時，在一體積固定的容器中，置入 9.60 克的氧氣與 5.60 克的氮氣，求得系統的總壓力為 2.46 大氣壓，則：(1) 容器體積為多少升？(2) 氧氣與氮氣所提供的壓力各為何？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 5.00 L；(2) P(O₂) ＝ 1.48 atm、P(N₂) ＝ 0.984 atm","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）(1) n(O₂) ＝ 9.60/32.0 ＝ 0.300 mol，n(N₂) ＝ 5.60/28.0 ＝ 0.200 mol。V ＝ nRT/P ＝ 0.500 × 0.0821 × 300 ÷ 2.46 ＝ 5.00 L。(2) P(O₂) ＝ 2.46 × 0.300/0.500 ＝ 1.48 atm；P(N₂) ＝ 2.46 × 0.200/0.500 ＝ 0.984 atm。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":84,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"道耳頓分壓定律","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-7（課本第84頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q13","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-7","type":"calculation","question":"溫度 27.0°C 時，在一體積固定的容器中，取 44.0 克的 CO₂(g) 與 128 克的 SO₂(g) 混合。若測其總壓為 900 毫米汞柱，試求：(1) CO₂(g) 的分壓為若干毫米汞柱？(2) SO₂(g) 的莫耳分率為何？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 300 mmHg；(2) 2/3（約 0.667）","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）n(CO₂) ＝ 44.0/44.0 ＝ 1.00 mol，n(SO₂) ＝ 128/64.0 ＝ 2.00 mol。(1) P(CO₂) ＝ 900 × 1/3 ＝ 300 mmHg。(2) X(SO₂) ＝ 2/3 ≈ 0.667。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":84,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"道耳頓分壓定律、莫耳分率","difficulty":"易","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-7（課本第84頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q14","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"例2-8","type":"calculation","question":"取氯酸鉀與二氧化錳固體置於試管內，混合加熱會發生下列反應：2KClO₃(s) → 2KCl(s) ＋ 3O₂(g)（MnO₂ 催化）。在 27.0°C、767 毫米汞柱時以排水集氣法收集氧氣 500 毫升，假設集氣瓶內外液面等高，已知 27.0°C 時水的飽和蒸氣壓為 27.0 毫米汞柱。試問：(1) 收集到的氧氣分壓為若干毫米汞柱？(2) 氧氣的莫耳數約為多少莫耳？(3) 若將乾燥氧氣改置於 0°C、1.00 大氣壓下，則其體積會變為多少毫升？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 740 mmHg；(2) 0.0200 mol；(3) 448 mL","explanation":"（答案依課本例題解答，已獨立驗算一致）(1) P(O₂) ＝ 767 − 27.0 ＝ 740 mmHg。(2) n ＝ PV/RT ＝ (740/760) × 0.500 ÷ (0.0821 × 300) ≈ 0.0200 mol。(3) STP 下 V ＝ 0.0200 × 22.4 ＝ 0.448 L ＝ 448 mL。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":86,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 例2-8（課本第86頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q15","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"練2-8","type":"calculation","question":"溫度 25.0°C、1.0 大氣壓時，利用金屬鋅（Zn）與稀鹽酸（HCl）反應來製備氫氣，並以排水集氣法收集該氣體：Zn(s) ＋ HCl(aq) → ZnCl₂(aq) ＋ H₂(g)（未平衡）。當實驗完成時，收集瓶內的液面與瓶外的液面等高，且該溫度下，水的飽和蒸氣壓為 23.8 毫米汞柱，若容器體積為 820 毫升，則：(1) 集氣瓶中氫氣的壓力為多少毫米汞柱？(2) 集氣瓶中氫氣的莫耳數為多少莫耳？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 736.2 mmHg；(2) 約 0.0325 mol","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(1) 液面等高，P(H₂) ＝ 760 − 23.8 ＝ 736.2 mmHg。(2) n ＝ (736.2/760) × 0.820 ÷ (0.0821 × 298) ≈ 0.0325 mol。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":86,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.94,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中等","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 練2-8（課本第86頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q16","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題1","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】下列哪些並非氣體的一般性質？","options":["(A) 氣體是由不斷運動的粒子所組成","(B) 氣體可充滿任何容器，故無一定的形狀","(C) 空氣中的氣體組成不具酸、鹼性，皆為中性狀態","(D) 氣體分子間的距離大，因此不具壓縮性","(E) 氣體壓力的形成是因為氣體撞擊容器器壁而形成"],"answer":"(C)(D)","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(C) 空氣中含 CO₂ 等酸性氣體，且「不具酸鹼性」不是氣體的通性；(D) 分子間距離大，所以「具有」壓縮性。(A)(B)(E) 都是氣體的通性。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":92,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"氣體的通性","difficulty":"易","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題1（課本第92頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q17","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題2","type":"single_choice","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）有一測量氣體體積裝置：左邊為開口的水銀槽，以透明軟管與右邊的量氣管相連，左邊水銀面比右邊高 h。定溫時在 1 大氣壓力下，開始時左右兩邊水銀面的高度差 h 為 380 mm，氣體體積為 V。如將左邊的水銀槽降低，使左右兩邊水銀面的高度差減少至 h 為 190 mm，此時右邊量管內 V 之變化為何？","options":["(A) V 減半","(B) V 增大 20.0%","(C) V 增大 50.0%","(D) V 加倍","(E) V 不變"],"answer":"(B) V 增大 20.0%","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）氣體壓力由 760 ＋ 380 ＝ 1140 mmHg 降為 760 ＋ 190 ＝ 950 mmHg。1140V ＝ 950V′，V′ ＝ 1.2V，增大 20.0%。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":92,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律（壓力計）","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題2（課本第92頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q18","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題3","type":"single_choice","question":"如圖，定溫下置定量氣體於具有活塞的容器內（活塞表面積為 100 平方公分，重量不計），不加砝碼時氣體體積為 100 毫升。若活塞上方加 1 個質量為 W 公斤的砝碼時，氣體體積壓縮至 80.0 毫升。試問此時外界大氣壓力為多少 W？（單位為 kgw/cm²）","options":["(A) 4","(B) 2","(C) 0.5","(D) 0.08","(E) 0.04"],"answer":"(E) 0.04","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）不加砝碼時氣體壓力 ＝ P（大氣壓）；加砝碼後 ＝ P ＋ W/100（kgw/cm²）。P × 100 ＝ (P ＋ W/100) × 80，20P ＝ 0.8W，P ＝ 0.04W。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":92,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 選擇題","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 222\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">活塞面積 100 cm²（重量不計），定溫</text>\n<path d=\"M30 50 V190 H120 V50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"32\" y=\"80\" width=\"86\" height=\"108\" fill=\"#cfe3ff\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n<rect x=\"31\" y=\"72\" width=\"88\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n<text x=\"75\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">100 mL</text>\n<text x=\"75\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">不加砝碼</text>\n<path d=\"M200 50 V190 H290 V50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"202\" y=\"108\" width=\"86\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#cfe3ff\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n<rect x=\"201\" y=\"100\" width=\"88\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n<text x=\"245\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">80.0 mL</text>\n<text x=\"245\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">加 1 個砝碼</text>\n<rect x=\"225\" y=\"74\" width=\"40\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n<text x=\"245\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"700\">W kg</text>\n</svg>","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題3（課本第92頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q19","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題4","type":"single_choice","question":"一容器內裝理想氣體，以一個可自由滑動之活塞構成左右二室。已知在 27°C 平衡時，左右兩室之體積均為 V。今將左室緩慢加熱至 127°C，右室保持原來溫度，則左室氣體體積增加了多少體積？","options":["(A) V/3","(B) V/5","(C) V/7","(D) V/9","(E) V/2"],"answer":"(C) V/7","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）兩室壓力相同、莫耳數相同，V ∝ T：左：右 ＝ 400：300 ＝ 4：3，總體積 2V，左室 ＝ 8V/7，增加 V/7。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":92,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"查理定律的應用","difficulty":"難","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題4（課本第92頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q20","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題5","type":"single_choice","question":"一密閉容器盛裝 C₄H₁₀(g) 及 O₂(g)，在 400 K 時，測得此混合氣體之壓力為 540 mmHg。點火使該混合氣體恰完全反應（C₄H₁₀(g) 與 O₂(g) 均用盡），容器內僅含 CO(g)、CO₂(g) 及 H₂O(g) 混合氣體，同溫下測得其總壓變為 720 mmHg，則該反應式可表示為何？","options":["(A) C₄H₁₀(g) ＋ 6O₂(g) → CO(g) ＋ 3CO₂(g) ＋ 5H₂O(g)","(B) 3C₄H₁₀(g) ＋ 18O₂(g) → 3CO(g) ＋ 9CO₂(g) ＋ 15H₂O(g)","(C) 2C₄H₁₀(g) ＋ 11O₂(g) → 4CO(g) ＋ 4CO₂(g) ＋ 10H₂O(g)","(D) 3C₄H₁₀(g) ＋ 17O₂(g) → 5CO(g) ＋ 7CO₂(g) ＋ 15H₂O(g)","(E) 4C₄H₁₀(g) ＋ 23O₂(g) → 6CO(g) ＋ 10CO₂(g) ＋ 20H₂O(g)"],"answer":"(E) 4C₄H₁₀(g) ＋ 23O₂(g) → 6CO(g) ＋ 10CO₂(g) ＋ 20H₂O(g)","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）同溫同容下壓力比 ＝ 莫耳數比，生成物：反應物 ＝ 720：540 ＝ 4：3。(A) 9：7、(B) 27：21 ＝ 9：7、(C) 18：13、(D) 27：20、(E) 36：27 ＝ 4：3；(E) 原子也守恆（C 16、H 40、O 46）。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":93,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"分壓與反應計量","difficulty":"難","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題5（課本第93頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q21","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題6","type":"single_choice","question":"有甲、乙兩種氣體，各重 0.96 g 及 0.56 g。在同溫、同壓時，甲氣體之體積為乙氣體之 3 倍，若知乙氣體之分子量為 28，則下列分子何者可能為甲氣體？","options":["(A) CH₄","(B) NO","(C) CO₂","(D) NO₂","(E) O₃"],"answer":"(A) CH₄","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）n(乙) ＝ 0.56/28 ＝ 0.020 mol；同溫同壓體積為 3 倍，n(甲) ＝ 0.060 mol，M ＝ 0.96/0.060 ＝ 16，為 CH₄。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":93,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"易","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題6（課本第93頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q22","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題7","type":"single_choice","question":"汽車常裝有安全氣囊，當強烈碰撞時，瞬間引起下列反應：NaN₃(s) → Na(s) ＋ N₂(g)（注意：此方程式尚未平衡），所產生的氣體快速充滿氣囊，可以達到保護車內人員安全的目的。若氣囊中 65 克的 NaN₃ 完全分解，在 1 atm、25°C 時，氣囊會膨脹至約多大的體積？（若將氮氣視為理想氣體）","options":["(A) 15 L","(B) 20 L","(C) 25 L","(D) 30 L","(E) 35 L"],"answer":"(E) 35 L","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）2NaN₃ → 2Na ＋ 3N₂。NaN₃ ＝ 65 g/mol，65 g 為 1.0 mol，生成 N₂ 1.5 mol；V ＝ 1.5 × 0.082 × 298 ≈ 36.7 L，最接近 35 L。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":93,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.9,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式與反應計量","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題7（課本第93頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q23","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題8","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】室溫下，下列哪幾組氣體的組合，不適用道耳頓分壓定律？","options":["(A) NH₃、HCl","(B) N₂、O₂","(C) O₂、CO","(D) O₂、H₂","(E) NO、O₂"],"answer":"(A)(E)","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）混合時會反應的氣體不適用：(A) NH₃ ＋ HCl → NH₄Cl(s)；(E) 2NO ＋ O₂ → 2NO₂。(B)(C)(D) 室溫下不反應。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":93,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.94,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"道耳頓分壓定律的限制","difficulty":"易","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題8（課本第93頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q24","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題9","type":"single_choice","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）三個分別裝有相同理想氣體的定容容器以活栓相連，開始時各活栓關閉，各容器內的氣體體積及壓力分別為 3.00 L、3.00 atm；4.00 L、4.00 atm；5.00 L、5.00 atm。若定溫下，將各活栓打開，當容器內氣體達到平衡後，若忽略各活栓的體積，則容器內的壓力應變為多少大氣壓（atm）？","options":["(A) 3.60","(B) 3.98","(C) 4.17","(D) 4.80","(E) 5.20"],"answer":"(C) 4.17","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）定溫下 P ＝ ΣPV/ΣV ＝ (9 ＋ 16 ＋ 25)/12 ≈ 4.17 atm。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":93,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"分壓定律（混合）","difficulty":"易","section":"習題 選擇題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題9（課本第93頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q25","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題10","type":"fill_blank","question":"附表為一些真實氣體的性質及 S.T.P. 下的莫耳體積（L/mol）與分子量：氦 He 22.44、4.000；氫 H₂ 22.43、2.020；氮 N₂ 22.40、28.02；甲烷 CH₄ 22.36、16.04；氯化氫 HCl 22.25、36.47；氨 NH₃ 22.08、17.03；氯 Cl₂ 22.18、70.91。則：(1) STP 時在真實氣體中，哪些氣體的莫耳體積大於理想氣體的莫耳體積（22.41 L/mol）？(2) 參考附表，試說明分子量相近的甲烷與氨，為何氨的氣體其莫耳體積偏離理想值較大？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 氦（He）與氫（H₂）；(2) 氨分子間作用力（氫鍵、極性）較大","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(1) 22.44、22.43 大於 22.41，為 He 與 H₂。(2) CH₄ 為非極性分子，NH₃ 為極性分子且分子間有氫鍵，分子間引力較大，使莫耳體積明顯小於理想值；兩者分子量相近，差異來自分子間作用力而非分子量。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":94,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"理想氣體與真實氣體","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 綜合題","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 236\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<text x=\"180.0\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">真實氣體在 STP 下的莫耳體積</text>\n<rect x=\"1\" y=\"24\" width=\"358\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#eef0f5\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"154\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<line x1=\"1\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<line x1=\"111\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"111\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"251\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"251\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"359\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氣體</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">莫耳體積 (L/mol)</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">分子量</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氦 He</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.44</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">4.000</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氫 H₂</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.43</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">2.020</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氮 N₂</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.40</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">28.02</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">甲烷 CH₄</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.36</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">16.04</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氯化氫 HCl</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.25</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">36.47</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"197\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氨 NH₃</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"197\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.08</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"197\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">17.03</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">氯 Cl₂</text>\n<text x=\"181\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">22.18</text>\n<text x=\"306\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">70.91</text>\n</svg>","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題10（課本第94頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q26","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題11","type":"calculation","question":"如圖(一)所示，一玻璃管長 57 cm，管底封閉，在 25°C、1 atm 下裝滿氮氣後，鉛直倒壓入一水銀槽內，直到管底與水銀槽的水銀面等高，如圖(二)所示。若外界之壓力及溫度不變，則：(1) 管內氮氣高度應該變為多少公分？(2) 此時管內之氮氣壓力為多少 cmHg？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 38 cm；(2) 114 cmHg","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）整支管沒入水銀，氮氣柱高 h，管內汞面在槽面下 h cm，P ＝ 76 ＋ h。76 × 57 ＝ (76 ＋ h)h，h² ＋ 76h − 4332 ＝ 0，h ＝ 38 cm，P ＝ 114 cmHg。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":94,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.95,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律（汞柱封氣）","difficulty":"難","section":"習題 綜合題","figureMissing":true,"reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題11（課本第94頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q27","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題12","type":"fill_blank","question":"(甲)定比定律、(乙)波以耳定律、(丙)亞佛加厥定律、(丁)道耳頓分壓定律、(戊)倍比定律、(己)赫斯定律、(庚)查理定律、(辛)氣體反應體積定律。請由上面的選項選出最適當的配對答案（請以代號作答）：(1) 將注射筒的出口端以橡皮塞堵住，用力拉注射筒活塞會感覺愈來愈難拉出來。(2) 凹陷的乒乓球浸入熱水中，可恢復原形。(3) 吹氣入氣球，可使氣球變大。(4) 由哪三個定律可推導出理想氣體方程式？","options":[],"answer":"(1) 乙；(2) 庚；(3) 丙；(4) 乙、丙、庚","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(1) 定溫下體積變大、壓力變小，內外壓差使活塞難拉：波以耳定律。(2) 受熱體積膨脹：查理定律。(3) 氣體莫耳數增加體積變大：亞佛加厥定律。(4) 波以耳、查理、亞佛加厥三定律合併成 PV ＝ nRT。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":94,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"氣體定律","difficulty":"易","section":"習題 綜合題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題12（課本第94頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q28","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題13","type":"fill_blank","question":"（依原課本附圖以文字描述）溫度 150 K、壓力 1 atm 時，取 1 m³ 的定量空氣（圖中的 A 點），該空氣的狀態變化依序由 A → B → C → D → A：A(1 m³, 1 atm)、B(1 m³, 3 atm)、C(2 m³, 3 atm)、C → D 為曲線、D(6 m³, 1 atm)。則：(1) B 點的攝氏溫度為＿＿。(2) D 點的絕對溫度為＿＿。(3) 由 B 點到 C 點可用＿＿定律說明。(4) 由 C 點到 D 點可用＿＿定律說明。","options":[],"answer":"(1) 177°C；(2) 900 K；(3) 查理（查理－給呂薩克）；(4) 波以耳","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）T ∝ PV（定量）。(1) B：PV ＝ 3，T ＝ 450 K ＝ 177°C。(2) D：PV ＝ 6，T ＝ 900 K。(3) B → C 壓力不變、體積增大：查理定律。(4) C 與 D 的 PV 都是 6，C → D 為等溫曲線：波以耳定律。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":95,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"氣體定律（圖形）","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 綜合題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題13（課本第95頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q29","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"習題14","type":"calculation","question":"如圖，兩等體積之 A、B 玻璃容器，彼此以細管連通被（設細管體積可忽略不計），在 27°C 時，置入 0.7 莫耳之 H₂ 於其中，測得壓力為 0.5 atm。然後 A 容器浸在 127°C 之油浴中，而 B 容器浸在 27°C 的水浴中，最後達平衡。試求：(1) A 容器之體積。(2) A 容器之氫氣壓力為若干 atm？(3) A 容器之氫氣莫耳數。","options":[],"answer":"(1) 約 17.2 L；(2) 4/7 ≈ 0.571 atm；(3) 0.3 mol","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(1) 總體積 ＝ nRT/P ＝ 0.7 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 0.5 ＝ 34.44 L，A ＝ 17.22 L。(2)(3) 平衡後兩容器壓力相同、體積相同，n ∝ 1/T：n_A：n_B ＝ 300：400 ＝ 3：4，n_A ＝ 0.3 mol；P ＝ 0.3 × 0.082 × 400 ÷ 17.22 ≈ 0.571 atm（＝ 4/7 atm）。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":95,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式","difficulty":"難","section":"習題 綜合題","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 210\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#fde2c8\" stroke=\"#c97a2b\"/>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">油浴 127°C</text>\n<rect x=\"210\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#cfe7ff\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\"/>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">水浴 27°C</text>\n<circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"110\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text>\n<circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"110\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text>\n<path d=\"M85 65 V35 H275 V65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\">細管（體積忽略）</text>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">A、B 等體積，內含 H₂ 共 0.7 mol</text>\n</svg>","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 習題14（課本第95頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q30","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"素養2","type":"calculation","question":"運動科學中，最大攝氧量（VO₂ Max，單位 mL kg⁻¹ min⁻¹）為有氧運動體適能的評估依據。跑步的最大攝氧量可用庫柏測試（Cooper Test）計算：VO₂ Max ＝ (22.351 × 完成公里數) − 11.288（12 分鐘內可跑出的最長距離）；另一種為 1.5 英里（1 英里約等於 1.6 公里）測試跑：VO₂ Max ＝ 88.02 ＋ (3.716 × 性別) − (0.0753 × 體重（磅）) − (2.767 × 時間（分鐘）)，性別：男性代入 1、女性代入 0；1 公斤 ＝ 2.205 磅。(1) 一位體重 72 公斤的男性跑者，可於 12 分鐘內可完成 3600 公尺的測驗。則男性跑者若以相同速率完成 1.5 英里的測試，需花費多少分鐘完成？(2) 根據 (1) 的計算結果，試分別計算出該男性跑者於庫柏測試及 1.5 英里測試跑的最大攝氧量各為何？（取至小數點以下兩位）(4) 承上述的計算結果，試問每分鐘對於該跑者而言所吸的氧氣，於標準溫、壓下，相差多少克的氧氣？（標準溫度、壓力下，1 莫耳氣體等於 22.4 L；質量取至小數點以下兩位）","options":[],"answer":"(1) 8 分鐘；(2) 庫柏測試 69.18、1.5 英里測試 57.65（mL kg⁻¹ min⁻¹）；(4) 約 1.19 克","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）(1) 速率 3600 m/12 min ＝ 300 m/min；1.5 英里 ＝ 2400 m，需 8 分鐘。(2) 庫柏：22.351 × 3.6 − 11.288 ≈ 69.18；1.5 英里：88.02 ＋ 3.716 − 0.0753 × 72 × 2.205 − 2.767 × 8 ≈ 57.65。(4) 每分鐘相差 (69.18 − 57.65) × 72 ≈ 830 mL ＝ 0.830 L，0.830 ÷ 22.4 × 32 ≈ 1.19 g。原題第 (3) 小題為開放式說明題，未收錄。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":96,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.9,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"莫耳體積的應用","difficulty":"難","section":"習題 素養題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 素養題2（課本第96頁）","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q31","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"素養3-1","type":"single_choice","question":"波以耳定律、查理定律與亞佛加厥定律為大家所熟知的氣體三大定律，事實上還有另一位科學家（Guillaume Amontons）對氣體性質的發展貢獻並不亞於這三位。17 世紀末，法國物理學家紀堯姆・阿蒙頓於固定容器體積的條件下，討論定量氣體的氣體壓力（P）與溫度（T）的關係（阿蒙頓定律）。下列哪一個現象描述與阿蒙頓定律討論的內容相同？","options":["(A) 對著氣球吹氣，氣球體積不斷增加","(B) 熱氣球受熱後緩緩升空","(C) 呼吸運動使得肺泡膨脹收縮","(D) 家用瓦斯鋼桶在冬天天氣寒冷時不易氣化使用，夏天卻沒有此問題","(E) 凹陷的乒乓球泡過熱水後可以恢復原狀"],"answer":"(E) 凹陷的乒乓球泡過熱水後可以恢復原狀","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）阿蒙頓定律：定容、定量下 P ∝ T。乒乓球內氣體受熱、壓力升高把凹陷處推回原狀，最符合定容下壓力隨溫度上升。(A) 亞佛加厥定律；(B) 定壓下體積變大、密度變小（查理定律）；(C) 波以耳定律；(D) 液化石油氣的蒸氣壓隨溫度改變。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":97,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.88,"needsReview":true,"knowledgePoint":"定容下壓力與溫度","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 素養題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 素養題3（課本第97頁）","groupId":"tm_30_g1","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_30_q32","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"素養3-2","type":"calculation","question":"承上題，阿蒙頓定律實驗以隔水加熱法控制定容裝置的溫度，測得溫度（°C）與定容裝置中的氣體壓力（mmH₂O）：20.0／10336、50.0／11346、55.0／11536、60.0／11716、70.0／12046、80.0／12386、82.0／12457（1.0 大氣壓 ＝ 1013 hPa ＝ 10336 mmH₂O）。根據圖形的數據，找出可能的線性回歸方程式為 y ＝ 34.25x ＋ 9650（x 為攝氏溫度，y 為壓力），則絕對零度的攝氏溫度（°C）可能為何？（取至小數點後第一位）","options":[],"answer":"約 −281.8°C","explanation":"（課本照片未含解答頁，答案與詳解為 AI 獨立計算）絕對零度時氣體壓力為 0：0 ＝ 34.25x ＋ 9650，x ＝ −9650/34.25 ≈ −281.8°C。（實驗值與 −273.15°C 有誤差。）","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":97,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.92,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"查理定律與絕對零度","difficulty":"中等","section":"習題 素養題","reference":"竹圍高中高二化學課本 第2章 氣體 素養題3（課本第97頁）","groupId":"tm_30_g1","supplementId":"tm_30"},{"id":"tm_31_q1","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"以閉口式壓力計（閉口端為真空）測量某容器內的氣體壓力，兩側汞面高度差為 45.6 cm，則氣體壓力為多少 atm？","options":["0.40","0.60","1.60","45.6"],"answer":"0.60","explanation":"閉口式壓力計的閉口端為真空，氣體壓力等於汞柱高度差：P ＝ 45.6 cmHg ＝ 45.6 ÷ 76 ＝ 0.60 atm。(C) 是誤加了 1 atm；(D) 是單位錯誤（cmHg 不是 atm）；(A) 是 1 − 0.60 的誤算。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"閉口式壓力計","difficulty":"易","reference":"教材重點「氣體壓力的測量：閉口式壓力計 Pgas ＝ Δh」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q2","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"大氣壓力為 760 mmHg 時，以開口式壓力計測量某氣體，發現開口端的汞面比氣體端的汞面低 120 mm，則氣體壓力為多少 mmHg？","options":["880","760","640","120"],"answer":"640","explanation":"開口端汞面較低，表示氣體端被推得較少，氣體壓力小於大氣壓：Pgas ＋ 120 ＝ 760，Pgas ＝ 640 mmHg。(A) 是把高低方向弄反；(B) 是兩側等高時的情形；(D) 是只取高度差。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"開口式壓力計","difficulty":"易","reference":"教材重點「開口式壓力計需考慮外界大氣壓」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q3","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"3","type":"single_choice","question":"1.5 atm 相當於多少 kPa？（1 atm ＝ 1.013 × 10⁵ Pa）","options":["152","114","1520","1140"],"answer":"152","explanation":"1.5 × 1.013 × 10⁵ Pa ＝ 1.52 × 10⁵ Pa ＝ 152 kPa。(B) 是 1.5 × 76 的 cmHg 數值；(D) 是 1.5 × 760 的 mmHg 數值；(C) 是 10 的次方換算錯誤。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"壓力單位換算","difficulty":"易","reference":"教材重點「1 atm ＝ 1.013 × 10⁵ Pa」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q4","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"4","type":"single_choice","question":"定溫下，將 2.0 L、3.0 atm 的定量氣體壓縮成 0.50 L，壓力變為多少 atm？","options":["0.75","1.5","6.0","12"],"answer":"12","explanation":"波以耳定律 P₁V₁ ＝ P₂V₂：3.0 × 2.0 ＝ P₂ × 0.50，P₂ ＝ 12 atm。(A) 是把壓力與體積當成正比；(B)(C) 是倍數算錯。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律","difficulty":"易","reference":"教材重點「波以耳定律：定溫、定量，PV ＝ k」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q5","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"5","type":"single_choice","question":"定壓下，將 27°C、3.0 L 的定量氣體加熱至 127°C，體積變為多少 L？","options":["14.1","4.0","3.3","2.25"],"answer":"4.0","explanation":"查理定律須用絕對溫度：V₂ ＝ 3.0 × (400 ÷ 300) ＝ 4.0 L。(A) 是直接用攝氏溫度 3.0 × 127/27；(D) 是把溫度比倒過來；(C) 沒有依比例計算。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"查理定律、絕對溫度","difficulty":"易","reference":"教材重點「查理－給呂薩克定律：定壓、定量，V ∝ T(K)」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q6","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"6","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫、同壓下，質量相同的下列四種氣體，何者的體積最大？","options":["O₂","CO₂","CH₄","H₂"],"answer":"H₂","explanation":"同溫同壓下體積與莫耳數成正比；質量相同時，莫耳數 ＝ 質量 ÷ 分子量，分子量愈小莫耳數愈多。H₂（2）分子量最小，體積最大；CH₄ 16、O₂ 32、CO₂ 44 依序較小。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"易","reference":"教材重點「亞佛加厥定律：定溫、定壓，V ∝ n」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q7","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"7","type":"single_choice","question":"標準溫壓（0°C、1 atm）下，某氣體 5.6 L 的質量為 11 g，此氣體可能為何？","options":["CO₂","O₂","SO₂","CH₄"],"answer":"CO₂","explanation":"STP 下莫耳體積 22.4 L，n ＝ 5.6 ÷ 22.4 ＝ 0.25 mol，M ＝ 11 ÷ 0.25 ＝ 44 g/mol，為 CO₂。O₂ 32、SO₂ 64、CH₄ 16 都不符合。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"莫耳體積、分子量","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「STP 下理想氣體 1 mol 為 22.4 L」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q8","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"8","type":"single_choice","question":"在 27°C、1.00 atm 下測得某氣體的密度為 1.14 g/L，此氣體最可能是下列何者？（R ＝ 0.082 atm·L/(mol·K)）","options":["He","CH₄","N₂","CO₂"],"answer":"N₂","explanation":"PM ＝ dRT，M ＝ dRT ÷ P ＝ 1.14 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 1.00 ≈ 28.0 g/mol，為 N₂。He 4、CH₄ 16、CO₂ 44 都不符合。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"PM ＝ dRT","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「理想氣體方程式衍生 PM ＝ dRT」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q9","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"9","type":"single_choice","question":"一個體積固定的鋼瓶內，氣體在 27°C 時壓力為 2.0 atm。若將鋼瓶加熱至 177°C，瓶內壓力變為多少 atm？","options":["13.1","3.0","2.6","1.3"],"answer":"3.0","explanation":"定容、定量下壓力與絕對溫度成正比：P₂ ＝ 2.0 × (450 ÷ 300) ＝ 3.0 atm。(A) 是直接用攝氏溫度 2.0 × 177/27；(D) 是溫度比倒過來。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"定容下壓力與溫度","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「理想氣體方程式 PV ＝ nRT（n、V 固定時 P ∝ T）」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q10","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"10","type":"single_choice","question":"10.0 L 的容器內含 0.20 mol N₂ 與 0.30 mol O₂，溫度 27°C，則 O₂ 的分壓為多少 atm？（R ＝ 0.082 atm·L/(mol·K)）","options":["0.492","0.738","1.23","0.60"],"answer":"0.738","explanation":"O₂ 的分壓 ＝ n(O₂)RT ÷ V ＝ 0.30 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 10.0 ＝ 0.738 atm。(A) 是 N₂ 的分壓；(C) 是總壓；(D) 是只算莫耳分率 0.60。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"道耳頓分壓定律","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「分壓：混合氣體中某一成分所貢獻的壓力」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q11","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"11","type":"single_choice","question":"某混合氣體的總壓力為 1.00 atm，其中 N₂ 的莫耳分率為 0.78，則 N₂ 的分壓為多少 mmHg？","options":["0.78","167","593","760"],"answer":"593","explanation":"分壓 ＝ 總壓 × 莫耳分率 ＝ 760 mmHg × 0.78 ≈ 593 mmHg。(A) 是忘了換成 mmHg（0.78 atm）；(B) 是其他氣體的分壓 760 × 0.22；(D) 是總壓。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"莫耳分率與分壓","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「莫耳分率 Xₐ；PA ＝ Pt × XA」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q12","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"12","type":"single_choice","question":"以排水集氣法收集氧氣，在 25°C、大氣壓力 755 mmHg 時，集氣瓶內外液面等高。已知 25°C 時水的飽和蒸氣壓為 24 mmHg，則瓶內氧氣的分壓為多少 mmHg？","options":["779","755","731","24"],"answer":"731","explanation":"內外液面等高時，瓶內總壓 ＝ 大氣壓 ＝ P(O₂) ＋ P(H₂O)，P(O₂) ＝ 755 − 24 ＝ 731 mmHg。(A) 是把水蒸氣壓加上去；(B) 是忘了扣除水蒸氣壓。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「排水集氣法：收集到的氣體壓力需扣除該溫度下之水飽和蒸氣壓」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q13","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"13","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫、同壓下，體積相同的甲烷（CH₄）與氧氣（O₂），兩者的質量比（CH₄：O₂）為何？","options":["1：2","2：1","1：1","1：4"],"answer":"1：2","explanation":"同溫同壓同體積，莫耳數相同；質量比 ＝ 分子量比 ＝ 16：32 ＝ 1：2。(C) 是把體積比當成質量比；(B) 是比值倒置。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「亞佛加厥定律：同溫同壓下，相同體積之任何氣體含有相同之分子數」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q14","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"14","type":"single_choice","question":"下列哪一種氣體在哪一種狀況下，其行為最接近理想氣體？","options":["He，500 K、0.5 atm","He，200 K、5 atm","NH₃，500 K、0.5 atm","NH₃，200 K、5 atm"],"answer":"He，500 K、0.5 atm","explanation":"真實氣體在高溫、低壓下最接近理想氣體；分子間作用力愈小的氣體也愈接近。He 為分子間作用力最小的氣體，NH₃ 分子間有氫鍵、作用力大。所以高溫低壓下的 He 最接近理想氣體。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體與真實氣體","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「真實氣體偏離理想行為，偏離程度在低溫、高壓時最明顯」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q15","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"15","type":"single_choice","question":"一定量的氣體由 1.0 atm、27°C、2.0 L 變為 2.0 atm、327°C，其體積變為多少 L？","options":["1.0","4.0","8.0","2.0"],"answer":"2.0","explanation":"P₁V₁/T₁ ＝ P₂V₂/T₂：V₂ ＝ 2.0 × (1.0 ÷ 2.0) × (600 ÷ 300) ＝ 2.0 L。壓力加倍使體積減半，絕對溫度加倍使體積加倍，兩者抵消。(A) 只考慮壓力；(B) 只考慮溫度；(C) 是兩項都當成加倍。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"波以耳定律與查理定律的綜合","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「三大定律可整合成理想氣體方程式」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q16","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"16","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫下，A 容器（2.0 L、1.5 atm）與 B 容器（3.0 L、0.50 atm）裝有不互相反應的氣體，以體積可忽略的細管連通後達平衡，總壓力為多少 atm？","options":["2.0","1.0","0.90","0.45"],"answer":"0.90","explanation":"定溫下各氣體 PV 不變：總壓 ＝ (1.5 × 2.0 ＋ 0.50 × 3.0) ÷ (2.0 ＋ 3.0) ＝ 4.5 ÷ 5.0 ＝ 0.90 atm。(A) 是兩壓力直接相加；(B) 是兩壓力的平均；(D) 是除錯體積。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"道耳頓分壓定律","difficulty":"中等","reference":"教材重點「道耳頓分壓定律：總壓＝各分壓總和」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q17","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"17","type":"single_choice","question":"將 0.50 mol NH₃ 與 0.30 mol HCl 注入 10.0 L 的真空容器中，在 27°C 下完全反應生成 NH₄Cl(s)（固體體積可忽略），反應後容器內剩下的氣體與其壓力為何？（R ＝ 0.082 atm·L/(mol·K)）","options":["0.492 atm 的 NH₃","0.738 atm 的 HCl","1.97 atm 的混合氣體","0.492 atm 的 HCl"],"answer":"0.492 atm 的 NH₃","explanation":"NH₃ ＋ HCl → NH₄Cl(s)，係數比 1：1，HCl 為限量試劑，反應後剩下 NH₃ 0.50 − 0.30 ＝ 0.20 mol。P ＝ 0.20 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 10.0 ＝ 0.492 atm。(C) 是忽略反應直接把兩者分壓相加——會反應的氣體不適用分壓相加。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"混合時發生反應的氣體","difficulty":"難","reference":"教材重點「會發生化學反應氣體不適用分壓加總（如 HCl＋NH₃）」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q18","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"18","type":"single_choice","question":"定壓下，將開口容器中的空氣由 27°C 加熱到 227°C，原來容器內的空氣有百分之多少逸出容器？","options":["88%","60%","12%","40%"],"answer":"40%","explanation":"容器體積與壓力不變，留在容器內的莫耳數與絕對溫度成反比：剩下 300 ÷ 500 ＝ 60%，逸出 40%。(B) 是剩下的比例；(A)(C) 是用攝氏溫度計算的錯誤結果。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"查理定律的應用","difficulty":"難","reference":"教材重點「查理－給呂薩克定律：定壓下體積與溫度的關係」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q19","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"19","type":"single_choice","question":"定溫、定容的密閉容器中有 CO(g) 與 O₂(g)，分壓都是 2.0 atm。點火使其依 2CO(g) ＋ O₂(g) → 2CO₂(g) 完全反應後，恢復原溫度，容器內總壓為多少 atm？","options":["4.0","3.0","2.0","1.0"],"answer":"3.0","explanation":"定溫定容下分壓與莫耳數成正比，可直接用分壓做計量。CO 2.0 atm 完全反應，消耗 O₂ 1.0 atm、生成 CO₂ 2.0 atm；剩 O₂ 1.0 atm。總壓 ＝ 1.0 ＋ 2.0 ＝ 3.0 atm。(A) 是忽略反應；(C) 只算了 CO₂。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"分壓與反應計量","difficulty":"難","reference":"教材重點「道耳頓分壓定律適用互不反應的混合氣體；會反應者須先計算反應後剩餘氣體」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_31_q20","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"20","type":"single_choice","question":"某氣體在 0°C、1 atm 下的密度為 1.25 g/L。同一氣體在 273°C、2 atm 下的密度為多少 g/L？","options":["0.625","2.50","5.00","1.25"],"answer":"1.25","explanation":"由 PM ＝ dRT，同一氣體 d ∝ P/T：d₂ ＝ 1.25 × (2 ÷ 1) × (273 ÷ 546) ＝ 1.25 g/L。壓力加倍使密度加倍，絕對溫度加倍使密度減半，兩者抵消。(A) 只考慮溫度；(B) 只考慮壓力。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:50:33.771Z","knowledgePoint":"PM ＝ dRT","difficulty":"難","reference":"教材重點「PM ＝ dRT：同溫同壓下分子量與密度成正比」","supplementId":"tm_31"},{"id":"tm_32_q1","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"於 25℃，分別有 1 克的氫氣、甲烷及二氧化硫三種氣體。下列關於此三種氣體的敘述，哪一項正確？","options":["氫氣所含的分子數目最少","若三種氣體同置於一容器中，則三者的分壓相同","若三種氣體同置於一容器中，則氫氣的莫耳分率最大","若三種氣體均為 1 大氣壓，則二氧化硫的氣體體積最大","若三種氣體分別置於體積相同的三個容器中，則氫氣的密度最小"],"answer":"若三種氣體同置於一容器中，則氫氣的莫耳分率最大","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）質量相同時，莫耳數 ＝ 質量 ÷ 分子量：H₂（2）＞CH₄（16）＞SO₂（64）。氫氣的分子數最多，(A) 錯；同一容器中分壓與莫耳數成正比，三者分壓不同，(B) 錯；氫氣莫耳數最多，莫耳分率最大，(C) 對；同壓下體積與莫耳數成正比，氫氣體積最大，(D) 錯；質量相同、容器體積相同，密度相同，(E) 錯。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:53:33.894Z","knowledgePoint":"莫耳分率與分壓、亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"易","reference":"108學年度指定科目考試 化學考科 第4題（大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第2章 氣體","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","fit":"完全對應","note":"以莫耳數比較分壓、莫耳分率、同壓下體積與密度，皆屬本章（2-2 亞佛加厥定律、2-4 道耳頓分壓定律與莫耳分率）。"},"supplementId":"tm_32"},{"id":"tm_32_q2","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"四個容器在 300 K 下分別盛裝氣體。甲容器體積 25.0 升，裝入氦氣後，測得壓力為 1.0 大氣壓。乙容器體積 12.5 升，裝入氮氣後，測得壓力為 1.75 大氣壓。丙容器體積 25.0 升，裝入 0.5 莫耳二氧化碳。丁容器體積 12.5 升，裝入氧氣後，測得密度為 1.75 克/升。以上數據彙整如表 1。表1 容器：甲、乙、丙、丁；體積（升）：25.0、12.5、25.0、12.5；裝入的氣體：He、N₂、CO₂、O₂；測量所得數據：1.0 atm、1.75 atm、0.5 mol、1.75 g/L；計算所得原子數：甲 1.01 mol、丁 1.37 mol（乙、丙未列）。假設所有氣體均可視為理想氣體，則有關此四個容器內原子數目多寡的排序，下列哪一項正確？（提示：0.082 × 300 ＝ 24.6）","options":["甲＞乙＞丁＞丙","丁＞丙＞乙＞甲","乙＞丁＞甲＞丙","乙＞丙＞丁＞甲","丙＞乙＞丁＞甲"],"answer":"乙＞丙＞丁＞甲","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）乙：n(N₂) ＝ PV/RT ＝ 1.75 × 12.5 ÷ 24.6 ≈ 0.889 mol，N₂ 為雙原子分子，原子 ≈ 1.78 mol。丙：CO₂ 0.5 mol，每分子 3 個原子，原子 1.5 mol。丁（表中已算出）1.37 mol；甲 1.01 mol。所以乙＞丙＞丁＞甲。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:53:33.894Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式","difficulty":"中等","reference":"106學年度指定科目考試 化學考科 第9題（大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第2章 氣體","section":"2-3 理想氣體方程式","fit":"完全對應","note":"由 PV ＝ nRT 與 PM ＝ dRT 求莫耳數，再乘上每分子原子數，屬本章 2-3。"},"supplementId":"tm_32"},{"id":"tm_32_q3","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"3","type":"single_choice","question":"王同學以排水集氣法做收集氧氣的實驗。當收集氧氣到達如圖 3 之(a)所示的程度時，隨即停止收集，並將收集瓶向下壓如圖 3 之(b)所示，使得 h₃＋h₄ 小於 h₁＋h₂。（原卷圖 3 以文字描述：(a) 集氣瓶倒立於水槽中，瓶內水面比瓶外水面高 h₁，瓶內水面上方的氣柱高 h₂；(b) 將集氣瓶向下壓後，瓶內水面比瓶外水面高 h₃，氣柱高 h₄。）若根據上述實驗，則下列哪一敘述正確？（假設大氣壓力為一大氣壓，溫度為 25℃）","options":["h₁ 等於 h₃","h₂ 小於 h₄","壓縮後，收集瓶內水的蒸氣壓變大","壓縮前後，收集瓶內的氣態水分子數目維持不變","（收集瓶內的氧氣壓力）加上（液柱高度壓力），再加上（水的蒸氣壓），其總和恰等於一大氣壓"],"answer":"（收集瓶內的氧氣壓力）加上（液柱高度壓力），再加上（水的蒸氣壓），其總和恰等於一大氣壓","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）瓶內水面高於瓶外時，同一水平面壓力相等：P(O₂) ＋ P(H₂O) ＋ 液柱壓力 ＝ 大氣壓，(E) 對。下壓後瓶內氣體被壓縮、壓力變大，液柱 h₃ 比 h₁ 小、氣柱 h₄ 比 h₂ 短，(A)(B) 錯；溫度不變，水的飽和蒸氣壓不變，(C) 錯；氣柱體積變小、蒸氣壓不變，氣態水分子數減少（部分凝結），(D) 錯。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:53:33.894Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"難","reference":"106學年度指定科目考試 化學考科 第20題（大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第2章 氣體","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","fit":"完全對應","note":"排水集氣法的壓力校正（扣除水的飽和蒸氣壓、液柱高度換算）屬本章 2-4.2 氣壓的校正。"},"supplementId":"tm_32"},{"id":"tm_32_q4","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"4","type":"single_choice","question":"（第18–19題為題組）林同學欲探究實驗室內一瓶陳舊氯酸鉀（KClO₃）試藥的純度，由上課所學得知：氯酸鉀在高溫下可完全分解產生氯化鉀和氧氣，於是取此氯酸鉀試樣 1.50 g，將其加熱分解，以排水集氣法收集氧氣，直到不再有氧氣產生，共收集 250 mL 的氧氣。若實驗時，水的溫度為 32℃、大氣壓力為 736 mmHg。依上述實驗數據，試回答下列問題。（已知 32℃時水的飽和蒸氣壓為 36 mmHg，且氧氣的溶解度極小，可忽略不計） 此實驗共收集多少莫耳的氧氣？","options":["1.6×10⁻³","4.1×10⁻³","9.2×10⁻³","8.8×10⁻²","7.3×10⁻²"],"answer":"9.2×10⁻³","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）氧氣分壓 ＝ 736 − 36 ＝ 700 mmHg ≈ 0.921 atm。n ＝ PV/RT ＝ 0.921 × 0.250 ÷ (0.082 × 305) ≈ 9.2×10⁻³ mol。常見錯誤：忘了扣除水的飽和蒸氣壓，或溫度沒有換成絕對溫度。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:53:33.894Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中等","reference":"107學年度指定科目考試 化學考科 第18題（第18–19題題組，大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第2章 氣體","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","fit":"完全對應","note":"扣除水的飽和蒸氣壓後以 PV ＝ nRT 求莫耳數，屬本章 2-4.2 氣壓的校正。"},"groupId":"tm_32_g1","supplementId":"tm_32"},{"id":"tm_32_q5","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"5","type":"single_choice","question":"（第18–19題為題組）林同學欲探究實驗室內一瓶陳舊氯酸鉀（KClO₃）試藥的純度，由上課所學得知：氯酸鉀在高溫下可完全分解產生氯化鉀和氧氣，於是取此氯酸鉀試樣 1.50 g，將其加熱分解，以排水集氣法收集氧氣，直到不再有氧氣產生，共收集 250 mL 的氧氣。若實驗時，水的溫度為 32℃、大氣壓力為 736 mmHg。依上述實驗數據，試回答下列問題。（已知 32℃時水的飽和蒸氣壓為 36 mmHg，且氧氣的溶解度極小，可忽略不計） 此氯酸鉀試藥的純度，最接近下列哪一數值（%）？","options":["32","50","75","89","95"],"answer":"50","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）由上一題，O₂ ≈ 9.2×10⁻³ mol。2KClO₃ → 2KCl ＋ 3O₂，KClO₃ ＝ 9.2×10⁻³ × 2/3 ≈ 6.1×10⁻³ mol，質量 ≈ 6.1×10⁻³ × 122.5 ≈ 0.75 g，純度 ≈ 0.75 ÷ 1.50 ＝ 50%。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:53:33.894Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法與化學計量","difficulty":"難","reference":"107學年度指定科目考試 化學考科 第19題（第18–19題題組，大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第2章 氣體","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","fit":"部分對應","note":"求氧氣莫耳數屬本章 2-4.2；由反應式係數比換算氯酸鉀質量與純度需第1章的化學計量。"},"groupId":"tm_32_g1","supplementId":"tm_32"},{"id":"tm_32_q6","materialId":"tm_29","questionNumber":"6","type":"single_choice","question":"已知氨氣與氯化氫反應後，可生成固體的產物，其反應式如下：NH₃(g) + HCl(g) → NH₄Cl(s) 假設有一裝置容器，左、右各是 2.00 公升的球體，中間有一個氣體閥門（如圖 1）。（原卷附圖略，本題作答不需參考）在 27°C，先將中間的氣體閥門關起來，在右邊球體內裝入 6.80 克的氨氣，在左邊球體裝入 2.46 atm 的氯化氫氣體。置入氣體後，將左、右氣體閥門關閉，再將中間氣體閥門打開，使左、右氣體完全混合且反應完全。假設氨氣和氯化氫氣體皆為理想氣體，且反應前後溫度不變，生成的固體體積可忽略。上述實驗後，容器內所剩的氣體與其壓力為何？","options":["1.23 atm的氨氣","2.46 atm的氨氣","3.69 atm的氨氣","1.23 atm的氯化氫","2.46 atm的氯化氫"],"answer":"1.23 atm的氨氣","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）氨氣 6.80 g ÷ 17 g/mol ＝ 0.400 mol；氯化氫由 PV ＝ nRT，n ＝ 2.46 × 2.00 ÷ (0.082 × 300) ＝ 0.200 mol。兩者係數比 1：1，氯化氫為限量試劑，反應後剩氨氣 0.200 mol。打開閥門後總體積 4.00 L，P ＝ 0.200 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 4.00 ＝ 1.23 atm。混合時會反應的氣體不能直接把分壓相加，要先算反應後剩下的氣體。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-04T06:53:33.894Z","knowledgePoint":"混合時發生反應的氣體","difficulty":"中等","reference":"111學年度分科測驗 化學考科 第1題（大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第2章 氣體","section":"2-4 氣體分壓","fit":"完全對應","note":"會反應的氣體不適用分壓相加，須先算反應後剩餘的氣體，再以 PV ＝ nRT 求壓力，屬本章 2-4（課本列舉 HCl＋NH₃ 為例）。"},"supplementId":"tm_32"}]};
